cl names a closure by a hash of the file, <lambda_...>, and inlines its call operator away, where cxx1 writes ??R$_N@... - the shape anonymous-union.nocl records; nothing links against a closure. cxx1 emits an implicit or local member, or a vbase destructor ??_D, that cl inlines at its one use and so does not emit - the shape virtual-base-diamond.nocl records. Measured by names-vs-cl at rv-I, 2026-11-13.
